<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <title>menosketiago™ — Volvo Cars Mobile Design System</title>

    {{> head/meta}}
    {{> head/og}}
    {{> head/links-scripts}}
</head>

<body class="theme-dark">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <header class="work-header">
            {{> layout/work-header}}
        </header>

        <main class="work-main">
            <section class="summary">
                <h1>Volvo Cars Mobile DS</h1>

                <figure>
                    <picture>
                        <source srcset="/images/volvo/splash.avif 1x, /images/volvo/splash-2x.avif 2x"
                            type="image/avif">
                        <source srcset="/images/volvo/splash.webp 1x, /images/volvo/splash-2x.webp 2x"
                            type="image/webp">
                        <img src="/images/volvo/splash.jpg" fetchpriority="high"
                            alt="One the left a hand holding a phone showing the old home tab of the Volvo Cars app, and on the right two hands holding a phone showing the 2026 design">
                    </picture>
                    <figcaption>The old home tab on the Volvo Car app (left) and the new late 2025 design update (right)
                    </figcaption>
                </figure>

                <aside>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="h-s">Role</h2>

                        <div class="pill-group">
                            <div class="pill">Design System Manager</div>
                            <div class="pill">Product Manager</div>
                            <div class="pill">Staff Product Designer</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2 class="h-s">Tools</h2>

                        <div class="pill-group masonry">
                            <div class="pill">JIRA</div>
                            <div class="pill">Figma</div>
                            <div class="pill">FigJam</div>
                            <div class="pill">ProtoPie</div>
                            <div class="pill">JavaScript</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2 class="h-s">Team</h2>

                        <div class="pill-group masonry">
                            <div class="pill">Alex Hedin</div>
                            <div class="pill">Malin Czernik</div>
                            <div class="pill">Daniil Gavrilov</div>
                            <div class="pill">Sara Ashour</div>
                            <div class="pill">Martin Delin</div>
                            <div class="pill">Richard Landérus</div>
                            <div class="pill">Richard Jarrett</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </aside>

                <article class="grid-2-2">
                    <h3>TLDR summary</h3>

                    <div>
                        <p>
                            From designers asking “Is this component available in iOS?” and engineers complaining about
                            not having the same designs in code as in Figma, to a 100% aligned Design System that made
                            it possible to ship several years of incredible design vision work — stuck inside slide
                            decks — to Volvo owners around the world.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            I fully refactored and evolved our Figma libraries, made sure components and patterns were
                            implemented in collaboration with engineering, and aligned with the overarching Design
                            Tokens architecture, guidelines, and other experience touchpoints like car and web.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Thanks to transparent communication, extensive documentation, and support for 120 designers
                            and engineers, I was able to become the acting Product Manager of a small but mighty team of
                            2 engineers and an Engineering Manager.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Together, we saved roughly 28 million SEK in engineering time and prevented accessibility
                            fines of up to 658 million, while going above WCAG 2.2 AAA level requirements.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </section>

            <h2>Full story</h2>

            {{!-- More work section --}}

            <h2 class="m-th">More work</h2>

            <section class="dual-column">
                {{> summaries/ericsson}}
                {{> summaries/trids}}
            </section>
        </main>

        {{!-- Back to top button --}}
        {{> back-to-top}}

        <footer>
            {{> layout/footer}}
        </footer>
    </div>

    {{> tooltip}}

    <div class="cursor"></div>

    {{!-- JS --}}
    <script src="/index.js" type="text/javascript"></script>
</body>

</html>